{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301702","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301702","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230170201:1":{"text":"블러디 로즈 뿐만 아니라 블러디 로즈와 죽음의 함대 때문일세.","source_cn":"不止血薇帮。是血薇帮和死潮舰队。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03B81F119F86036A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230170202:1":{"text":"바다에 안개가 짙게 끼고 몬스터까지 나타나는 바람에, 바다에 나간 뒤로 돌아오지 못하는 배가 수두룩해.","source_cn":"海上弥漫着迷雾，还有海怪出没，使得无数出海的船只至今未回。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0FF28DD06E7A034","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230170203:1":{"text":"그런데 러스트 항의 패거리들은 이럴 때 땅따먹기나 하고 있질 않나!","source_cn":"而锈锚港的帮派在这种时候却只想着争夺地盘！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x708530B00E7F9B21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230170204:1":{"text":"바다로 나간 옛 친구들이 돌아오지 못하고 있다고. 에휴...","source_cn":"我那些出海的旧友们都没回来，唉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x662183E19AA6DE8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:船长布莱杰":{"text":"선장 브리짓","source":"船长布莱杰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}